{
  "format": "beaver-grammar-table:v1",
  "description": "Cross-runtime citation and pinpoint grammars. Authored in the restricted dialect grammarTables.ts validates: JS-syntax named groups, no lookbehind, no \\p classes, no inline flags. Python compiles with re.ASCII and JS without the u flag, so \\d/\\w/\\b are ASCII in both.",
